{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Steps》把任何需要依固定順序完成的事情變成會自動運作的計時器，例如 HIIT 循環訓練、食譜步驟或早晨例行流程。只要輸入一次步驟並設定每步所需時間，按下開始便會倒數並提示何時進入下一步，手機放在口袋裡也能持續運作。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-146.webp\">\n<h2>倒數緊貼時鐘不中斷</h2>\n<p>倒數以時鐘為基準，不依賴應用程式保持開啟，鎖屏或接聽電話後回來，流程仍停在正確步驟與剩餘時間。每步可設定自動前進或手動點按等待，並可加入休息時間。運行時顯示大型倒數，每步轉換均有通知，支援鎖屏即時動態與 Apple Watch 震動提示，並可透過 iCloud 同步。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-30-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-31-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-32-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-33-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-34-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Steps: Routine Timer</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.757488+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":330,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T07:24:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T10:58:13.638079+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:18.640899+00:00","content_hash":"30929d7f2d9b73af33de8dc1a6bf12365a67a8e2403410f011c5b2c1eb95f245","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}